      "html_url": "https://github.com/Iskingcomet/Shamar-Roberts",
      "description": "<!Doctype html> <html>     <head> <style>     .myDiv{     border: 5 px blueviolet;     background-color:rgb(151, 21, 190);     text-align: center;     } </style> </head> <body>     <div class= \"myDiv\">     <h1> Welcome To My Website</h1> </div>  <hr> <form>     <div>         <input type=\"text\" placeholder =\" Type Your Name\" name =\"username_field\">     </div>      <p><a href=\"#Basic Information\">     Jump to Basic Information   </a></p>   <p><a href=\"#Education\">     Jump to Education   </a></p>   <p><a href=\"#Work Experience\">     Jump to Work Experience   </a></p>   <p><a href=\"#Programming Skill\">     Jump to Programming Skill   </a></p>   <p><a href=\"#General Interest\">     Jump to General Interest   </a></p>   <p><a href=\"#Favorite Song, Movie, And TV Show\">     Jump to Favorite Song, Movie, And TV Show   </a></p>   <p><a href=\"#Favorite Websites\">     Jump to Favorite Websites   </a></p>   <p><a href=\"#My Projects in this course\">     Jump to My Projects in this course   </a></p>   <hr>   <h2 id=\"Basic Information\"></h2>  <h1>Basic Information</h1>   </form> <p> My name is Shamar Roberts</p> <p> I am an <span style =\"Color: blue;font-weight:bold\">Information Technology Major</span>  with a concentration in <span style =\"Color: blue;font-weight:bold\">Business Administration</span> </p> <img src= \"https://www.stjohns.edu/sites/default/files/styles/unmodified/public/2021-06/OL2021_0000s_0000s_0004_Shamar%20Roberts.jpg?itok=j1yGY-BL\"> <hr>   <h2 id=\"Education\"></h2>  <h1> Education </h1> <P> For my current education I am currently enrolled in Undergrad but I plan to graduate in the Summer of 2022.     I am on track to graduate Magna Cum Laude. </P> <hr> <h2 id=\"Work Experience\"></h2> <h1>Work Experience</h1> <ul> <li>Brooklyn Campaign Against Hunger</li> <Li>Banana Republic</Li> <li>St John's University Campus Recreation</li> <li>St John's University Orientation Leader</li> </ul> <hr> <h2 id=\"Programming Skill\"></h2> <h1>Programming Skill</h1> <table>     <tr> <th>Progamming Language</th> <th>Level</th>      </tr>     <tr>     <td>C++</td>       <td>Beginner</td> </tr> <tr>  <td>R</td>  <td>Beginner</td>  </tr> <tr>    <td>JavaScript</td>      <td>Intermediate</td> </tr>  <tr>     <td>Python </td>     <td>Intermediate</td>  </tr> </table> <hr> <h2 id=\"General Interest\"></h2> <h1> General Interest</h1> <p> I think my general Interest are pretty basic compared to others. Some of the things that I love to do are play video games and instruments, cook different types of food, and to buy sneakers.</p>  <img src= \"https://preview.redd.it/tq7e1klto3061.jpg?auto=webp&s=3efad67ce2e88ee829ecd34e8fbaadce7d3515c6\" width = 50%> <img src= \"https://www.stjohns.edu/sites/default/files/styles/640w/public/2019-10/pep_band_sousaphone_player_960x640.jpg?itok=_Kf7FrOJ\" width = 50%>  <hr> <h2 id=\"Favorite Song, Movie, And TV Show\"></h2> <H1> Favorite Song, Movie, And TV Show</H1> <div class= \"iframe-container\">     <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ys1Gv4DMAbE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe> </div> <div class= \"iframe-container\">     <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ta7aBk9pDzk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe> </div> <div class= \"iframe-container\"> <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rnfgyz746gc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe> </div> <hr> <h2 id=\"Favorite Websites\"></h2> <h1>Favorite Websites</h1>  <li> <a href=\"https://www.nike.com/launch\" target= \"_blank\"> Click Here to go to Nike </a></li> <p>Through the Nike website I check for when new sneakers are being released in hopes to get a pair and resell them for extra money</p> <li> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com\" target= \"_blank\"> Click here to go to Youtube</a></li> <P>On youtube I watch random videos for when im doing random tasks such as eating or to learn how to do something new.</P> <li> <a href=\"https://pokemonshowdown.com\" target= \"_blank\"> Click here to go to Pokemon Showdown</a></li> <P>Pokemon Showdown is a fighting game that I love to play for childhood nostalgia. I get to fight other people online and build any team that I want.</P>  <hr> <h2 id=\"My Projects in this course\"></h2> <h1>My Projects in this course</h1>  <li> <a href=\"https://rkileaders.teachable.com/courses/web-application-development/lectures/13897368\" target= \"_blank\"> HTML, CSS, Bootstrap </a></li>     </body>  </html>",
